From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matteo Melli <matteom@ongres.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] feat: install preload_ora_misc.sql unconditionally

IvorySQL's initdb requires share/preload_ora_misc.sql whenever the
database_mode is DB_ORACLE (the default). That file, however, is only
installed by contrib/ivorysql_ora/meson.build, so builds with
contrib=false produce a tree where initdb fails with:

  initdb: error: file ".../share/preload_ora_misc.sql" does not exist

Move the install_data() call from contrib/ivorysql_ora/meson.build to
src/backend/utils/misc/meson.build (next to ivorysql.conf.sample) so the
file ships with every build regardless of the contrib option.
---
 contrib/ivorysql_ora/meson.build   | 5 -----
 src/backend/utils/misc/meson.build | 1 +
 2 files changed, 1 insertion(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/contrib/ivorysql_ora/meson.build b/contrib/ivorysql_ora/meson.build
--- a/contrib/ivorysql_ora/meson.build
+++ b/contrib/ivorysql_ora/meson.build
@@ -51,11 +51,6 @@ contrib_targets += ivorysql_ora
 install_data(
   'ivorysql_ora.control',
   kwargs: contrib_data_args,
 )
 
-install_data(
-  'preload_ora_misc.sql',
-  install_dir: dir_data,
-)
-
 tests += {
diff --git a/src/backend/utils/misc/meson.build b/src/backend/utils/misc/meson.build
--- a/src/backend/utils/misc/meson.build
+++ b/src/backend/utils/misc/meson.build
@@ -36,7 +36,8 @@ backend_link_with += static_library('guc-file',
 )
 
 install_data(
  'postgresql.conf.sample',
  'ivorysql.conf.sample',
+ '../../../../contrib/ivorysql_ora/preload_ora_misc.sql',
   install_dir: dir_data,
 )
-- 
